<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All of God’s riches compressed into this seed,</l><l>Equally precious faith, will meet our need;</l><l>God’s divine energy, virtue from within,</l><l>Supplies the way to make us just like Him.</l><l>Virtue brings knowledge of our Lord Jesus Christ,</l><l>God’s divine power, and Christ to be our life;</l><l>And, with all diligence, His life we will absorb,</l><l>While rooted, grounded in God’s Holy Word.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Self-control, dwells in the structure of the tree,</l><l>Self kept in check, from our spirit is set free;</l><l>Life now can flow and our passions and our lust</l><l>Will be restrained, for this in God we trust.</l><l>Christ our endurance will branch, increase, and grow;</l><l>Passing though hardship, Christ’s sufferings we know;</l><l>Our daily living with spirit exercised,</l><l>Expresses God to be our kingdom prize.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Godliness thrives in a garden of God’s love,</l><l>Brotherly love with a source from heav’n above,</l><l>Love so delightful, love steadfast, strong and pure.</l><l>A blooming love, a love that will endure.</l><l>Ultimate love is the sweet, eternal fruit,</l><l>God, as true love, through the branch, the trunk, and root;</l><l>Nobler and higher, such love we now shall be</l><l>Love growing, shining through eternity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
